    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A two-digit number is divisible by both 6 and 8. It is greater than 50 and less than 90.\nWhat is the number?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "72; the LCM of 6 and 8 is 24, and 72 is its only multiple between 50 and 90.",
      "worked": "The LCM of 6 and 8 is 24, so the number must be a multiple of 24.\n\nThe consecutive multiples $24,\\ 48,\\ 72,\\ 96$ show that only 72 is greater than 50 and less than 90.\n\nThe number is 72.",
